# Recollections (windurst 67, BLM AF2): Chumimi (Heaven's Tower), Laityn (Ru'Lude Gardens; his 10006 in his script),
# the Ore Door _4i5 (Castle Zvahl Keep; its trigger 9 in its script). The Three Magi completed by GM (no needToZone).
